nding parcels with our Shopify integration",[],"ltr","Get started",{"link_type":39,"key":40,"url":41},"Web","6882f395-1536-4383-9a58-c2272e8e41de","shopify-integration.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fcustomer\u002Fbulk-upload",null,{"link_type":44},"Any",{"dimensions":46,"alt":49,"copyright":42,"url":50,"id":51,"edit":52},{"width":47,"height":48},300,82,"Bulk","shopify-integration.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F0aab5fb6-1060-45a2-b8f8-b4f2e0646d37_bulk.svg","YhYpMBIAACoA0QBo",{"x":53,"y":53,"zoom":54,"background":55},0,1,"#fff",{},{"link_type":18},"page_header$df8492e5-5b34-4449-814a-f793ed48f45e","page_header",{"variation":61,"version":25,"items":62,"primary":64,"id":83,"slice_type":84,"slice_label":42},"cardWithImageNoCta",[63],{},{"CardImage":65,"CardAvatar":74,"CardTitle":75,"CardText":76,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":66,"alt":69,"copyright":42,"url":70,"id":71,"edit":72},{"width":67,"height":68},1000,667,"Business owner sat at a desk in their home office using their laptop to book multiple parcels","shopify-integration.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaTKam3NYClf9n2Of_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8377_bulksendscreenOption1.png?auto=format,compress","aTKam3NYClf9n2Of",{"x":53,"y":53,"zoom":54,"background":73},"transparent","none","Fast Shopify shipping with Evri",[77,80],{"type":33,"text":78,"spans":79,"direction":36},"If you have a Shopify store, you can import multiple orders at once with our bulk send tool. ",[],{"type":33,"text":81,"spans":82,"direction":36},"Simply connect your Shopify account with Evri, import customer orders, and choose your parcel defaults to make sending parcels even faster in future.",[],"card$b16564ad-499b-4909-a354-dc99a8cdf808","card",{"variation":86,"version":25,"items":87,"primary":161,"id":163,"slice_type":164,"slice_label":42},"listComponent",[88,101,113,125,137,149],{"title":89,"content":90,"icon":94},"One dashboard for everything",[91],{"type":33,"text":92,"spans":93,"direction":36},"Manage all your online orders from more than one marketplace together",[],{"dimensions":95,"alt":97,"copyright":42,"url":98,"id":99,"edit":100},{"width":96,"height":96},40,"Laptop icon","shopify-integration.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff4479625-5e04-45e8-9a20-77fa5893b64e_laptops.svg","Yh96GBIAAC8A-Zss",{"x":53,"y":53,"zoom":54,"background":73},{"title":102,"content":103,"icon":107},"Save time",[104],{"type":33,"text":105,"spans":106,"direction":36},"Shopify sellers can import recipient names and addresses automatically - no more manual imports",[],{"dimensions":108,"alt":109,"copyright":42,"url":110,"id":111,"edit":112},{"width":96,"height":96},"Icon of a clock","shopify-integration.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F40f1b5ea-7a5c-44d7-8e16-86d427c88a1d_its_too_late1.svg","Yh96GBIAACoA-Zsp",{"x":53,"y":53,"zoom":54,"background":55},{"title":114,"content":115,"icon":119},"Send UK & international parcels",[116],{"type":33,"text":117,"spans":118,"direction":36},"Book and manage UK and international parcels in the same place with ease",[],{"dimensions":120,"alt":121,"copyright":42,"url":122,"id":123,"edit":124},{"width":96,"height":96},"Above and beyond icon","shopify-integration.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41bf8079-3dd8-48b6-ad6b-013e68421339_above_and_beyond.svg","YflBvREAACIA8pXG",{"x":53,"y":53,"zoom":54,"background":73},{"title":126,"content":127,"icon":131},"Set parcel details",[128],{"type":33,"text":129,"spans":130,"direction":36},"Store your delivery preferences and defaults on parcel weight, size, cover, and more",[],{"dimensions":132,"alt":133,"copyright":42,"url":134,"id":135,"edit":136},{"width":96,"height":96},"Icon of a parcel","shopify-integration.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8321288c-05db-46b8-9767-db5da18fbfae_parcel1.svg","Yh96FhIAAC4A-Zr2",{"x":53,"y":53,"zoom":54,"background":55},{"title":138,"content":139,"icon":143},"Dispatch confirmation",[140],{"type":33,"text":141,"spans":142,"direction":36},"We automatically mark Shopify parcel deliveries as ‘dispatched’ and will add tracking numbers once we receive your items, keeping your customers updated",[],{"dimensions":144,"alt":145,"copyright":42,"url":146,"id":147,"edit":148},{"width":96,"height":96},"Phone icon","shopify-integration.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":53,"y":53,"zoom":54,"background":55},{"title":150,"content":151,"icon":155},"FREE end-to-end tracking",[152],{"type":33,"text":153,"spans":154,"direction":36},"Full online parcel tracking for both you and your customers, which means less time spent dealing with “where’s my parcel?” queries",[],{"dimensions":156,"alt":157,"copyright":42,"url":158,"id":159,"edit":160},{"width":96,"height":96},"Track location icon","shopify-integration.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8b145688-a43b-4d6e-b22c-b7b556cc29a2_track.svg","Yh96FRIAACgA-Zrj",{"x":53,"y":53,"zoom":54,"background":55},{"theme":29,"title":162,"description":42},"Why use bulk send?","list_block$dc43c513-fd0a-4298-9580-925a485c8891","list_block",{"variation":166,"version":25,"items":167,"primary":215,"id":218,"slice_type":164,"slice_label":42},"listNoIcon",[168,184,190,196,209],{"title":169,"content":170,"isNumbered":183},"Visit bulk send",[171],{"type":33,"text":172,"spans":173,"direction":36},"Log in to your Evri account and go to your bulk send dashboard.",[174,181],{"start":175,"end":176,"type":177,"data":178},43,62,"hyperlink",{"link_type":39,"url":179,"target":180},"\u002Fcustomer\u002Fbulk-upload","_blank",{"start":175,"end":176,"type":182},"strong",true,{"title":185,"content":186,"isNumbered":183},"Choose Shopify to link with your Evri account",[187],{"type":33,"text":188,"spans":189,"direction":36},"Follow the step-by-step instructions - they’re a little different for each marketplace",[],{"title":191,"content":192,"isNumbered":183},"Set your UK parcel defaults",[193],{"type":33,"text":194,"spans":195,"direction":36},"You'll need to set these for UK parcels before you can set international parcels.",[],{"title":197,"content":198,"isNumbered":183},"Set your international parcel defaults",[199],{"type":33,"text":200,"spans":201,"direction":36},"Scroll to \"sending international parcels?\" and select \"get started\" to set your international parcel defaults.",[202,206],{"start":203,"end":204,"type":205},11,41,"em",{"start":207,"end":208,"type":205},55,66,{"title":210,"content":211,"isNumbered":183},"Automatic order importing",[212],{"type":33,"text":213,"spans":214,"direction":36},"Your Shopify orders will auto-import, ready for you to start booking UK and international parcels in one place",[],{"theme":29,"title":216,"description":217,"showPaddingTop":20},"How to use Evri integrations","It’s easy to book a delivery for all your orders straight from your Evri account with our Shopify integration:","list_block$d7d3fec7-33d7-4369-9bbc-7cc69f5d9172",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":220,"primary":221,"id":235,"slice_type":236,"slice_label":42},[],{"title":222,"bodyText":223,"isEco":20,"PaddingTop":20,"PaddingBottom":20,"NoMarginBottom":20,"hasButton":20,"buttonText":42,"buttonLink":227,"image":228},"Are you VAT registered?",[224],{"type":33,"text":225,"spans":226,"direction":36},"Your business can claim back taxes on any parcels you send across the UK with us - that makes your parcels even cheaper!",[],{"link_type":44},{"dimensions":229,"alt":230,"copyright":42,"url":231,"id":232,"edit":233},{"width":67,"height":68},"A side profile view of a business owner sitting at a desk in their office using their laptop and smiling. Stacked parcel boxes can be seen in the background.","shopify-integration.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ3wUvJbqstJ99FvA_Smallbusinessowneronlaptop.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=2%2C0%2C7004%2C4672&w=1000&h=667","Z3wUvJbqstJ99FvA",{"x":234,"y":53,"zoom":54,"background":73},2,"feature_banner$b6129255-82cc-406b-b171-05915314395a","feature_banner",{"variation":238,"version":25,"items":239,"primary":301,"id":312,"slice_type":313,"slice_label":42},"3Column",[240,262,282],{"Title":241,"Description":246,"Image":250,"Label":42,"UrlText":244,"Url":258,"buttonDataGtmTrack":42,"SecondaryButtonText":42,"SecondaryButtonUrl":261,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":42,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[242],{"type":243,"text":244,"spans":245},"heading3","ParcelShops",[],[247],{"type":33,"text":248,"spans":249,"direction":36},"Choose from over 9,000+ ParcelShop locations, including corner shops and participating Post Offices. Print your label at home or in-store with our free Print In ParcelShop devices, and hand over your parcel for Courier collection.",[],{"dimensions":251,"alt":253,"copyright":42,"url":254,"id":255,"edit":256},{"width":67,"height":252},662,"Post Office ParcelShop","shopify-integration.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F19e68f6f-ac0d-4bce-b8c7-db5227dbfa2f_Option+1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C481%2C8192%2C5423&w=1000&h=662","ZgKfWhAAACkAd80m",{"x":53,"y":257,"zoom":54,"background":73},481,{"link_type":39,"key":259,"url":260},"22727d2b-f196-4c18-8712-7637eb8f7c8c","shopify-integration.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops",{"link_type":44},{"Title":263,"Description":267,"Image":271,"Label":42,"UrlText":265,"Url":278,"buttonDataGtmTrack":42,"SecondaryButtonText":42,"SecondaryButtonUrl":281,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":42,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[264],{"type":243,"text":265,"spans":266},"Lockers",[],[268],{"type":33,"text":269,"spans":270,"direction":36},"Search for your closest Locker using our ParcelShop and Locker finder. Book your parcel online, scan your barcode at the Locker, place your parcels in one of our secure Lockers available 24\u002F7. We’ll take care of everything from there.",[],{"dimensions":272,"alt":273,"copyright":42,"url":274,"id":275,"edit":276},{"width":67,"height":68},"Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out","shopify-integration.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C9%2C8164%2C5445&w=1000&h=667","Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb",{"x":53,"y":277,"zoom":54,"background":73},9,{"link_type":39,"key":279,"url":280},"159c8971-a578-4e81-93fa-cba226a6cedd","shopify-integration.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"link_type":44},{"Title":283,"Description":287,"Image":291,"Label":42,"UrlText":285,"Url":297,"buttonDataGtmTrack":42,"SecondaryButtonText":42,"SecondaryButtonUrl":300,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":42,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[284],{"type":243,"text":285,"spans":286},"Courier collection",[],[288],{"type":33,"text":289,"spans":290,"direction":36},"Can't drop off your parcels? We've got you covered! Simply arrange for one of our Couriers to collect your parcels from your home or office. Pick a convenient day, and we'll provide a 1-hour collection window to make things easier for you.",[],{"dimensions":292,"alt":293,"copyright":42,"url":294,"id":295,"edit":296},{"width":67,"height":68},"An Evri Courier scanning multiple parcels for a doorstep collection in a block of flats.","shopify-integration.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDqpbqstJ9-cfi_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4452.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6pDqpbqstJ9-cfi",{"x":53,"y":53,"zoom":54,"background":73},{"link_type":39,"key":298,"url":299},"d6de6e6a-2400-44f1-96a3-8e99e504145b","shopify-integration.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":44},{"SectionTitle":302,"SectionDescription":307,"theme":311},[303],{"type":304,"text":305,"spans":306,"direction":36},"heading2","Our 3 easy ways to send a parcel",[],[308],{"type":33,"text":309,"spans":310,"direction":36},"Choose from three easy options to book your